WEBVTT

01:32.301 --> 01:36.905
(Zhan Zhao Adventures)

01:36.986 --> 01:40.000
(Episode 34)

01:42.718 --> 01:44.901
Did Zhou Ji Liang send you here?

01:45.837 --> 01:47.060
I'm talking to you.

01:47.428 --> 01:48.651
Say something.

01:49.029 --> 01:50.252
Start talking!

01:51.701 --> 01:53.854
He has been drugged. He's not in his right mind anymore.

01:53.945 --> 01:55.496
I doubt we'll get any answers from him.

02:09.520 --> 02:10.743
You.

02:12.030 --> 02:13.253
Come here.

02:15.294 --> 02:16.517
Come here.

02:17.589 --> 02:21.155
About what I know, I'll tell only you.

02:22.093 --> 02:24.140
We can't let anyone else know.

02:25.349 --> 02:26.572
Come here.

02:27.574 --> 02:28.797
Come here.

02:33.357 --> 02:36.374
Shan Gui is hiding in your Huo family.

02:38.598 --> 02:42.266
Why do you keep helping Zhan Zhao investigate your own family?

02:43.413 --> 02:46.298
We're the ones on the same side here.

02:47.581 --> 02:50.347
Shan Gui is in your Huo family.

02:52.102 --> 02:54.707
A family member investigating another family member.

02:55.014 --> 02:56.237
How is there

02:56.492 --> 02:59.659
something so ridiculous in this world?

03:21.661 --> 03:24.324
At first, I thought my aunt brought this over from the Lin family.

03:24.415 --> 03:25.638
But I had no idea

03:27.080 --> 03:28.847
that this thing actually came from the Huo family.

03:35.532 --> 03:37.076
Have you already figured out

03:37.840 --> 03:39.880
the connection between the Huo family and Prince Xiangyang?

03:43.188 --> 03:44.875
Every move Hu Xiao Chen made

03:45.534 --> 03:47.134
was carefully thought out.

03:48.182 --> 03:49.405
As for the identification plan,

03:49.757 --> 03:51.827
if all he wanted was to protect Zhao Yue An,

03:52.166 --> 03:54.701
he could've just silenced Zhao Zheng De.

03:56.326 --> 03:58.011
He didn't have to bring your brother into this.

04:03.470 --> 04:04.959
After the identification plan that day,

04:05.640 --> 04:07.566
I started to have a lot of bad suspicions.

04:08.600 --> 04:10.367
But I didn't dare think too much about it.

04:12.334 --> 04:14.991
So I forced those thoughts down and tried to ignore them.

04:16.557 --> 04:17.718
Until last night

04:17.809 --> 04:20.884
when we discovered that the secret of Wanshan County was a gold mine.

04:22.440 --> 04:24.618
That was when I finally knew that I couldn't avoid it anymore.

04:26.925 --> 04:29.193
Although Linglong Manor is well-known in the martial world,

04:29.295 --> 04:30.900
not many people know

04:31.357 --> 04:33.769
the Huo family's ancestors were swordsmiths.

04:33.880 --> 04:36.008
They built their fortune through smelting and forging.

04:38.893 --> 04:40.116
Zhan.

04:40.560 --> 04:41.926
I have to return to the Huo family

04:42.766 --> 04:44.252
to get answers from my father and brother.

04:46.085 --> 04:47.308
Alright.

04:52.805 --> 04:54.550
Why did it take you so long to pick a horse?

04:54.700 --> 04:57.923
You can't ride just any ordinary horse. You need a proper steed.

05:01.880 --> 05:03.447
The Yaksha that showed up this morning

05:03.805 --> 05:05.251
might be targeting Zhan.

05:05.494 --> 05:07.400
- Watch over him.   - Don't worry.

05:16.960 --> 05:18.183
Giddy-up!

05:20.190 --> 05:21.413
Giddy-up!

05:34.300 --> 05:36.827
Take the token and bring the two kids with you.

05:37.333 --> 05:38.813
Go to the county office to get Siming.

05:38.904 --> 05:41.817
Find the imperial envoy in Xiangyang and hand Siming over to him.

05:42.120 --> 05:44.260
Let the two kids stay there for a few days.

05:44.351 --> 05:45.597
I'll stay in Gucheng County.

05:47.086 --> 05:48.309
Why?

05:53.760 --> 05:55.089
The magistrate of Gucheng County

05:56.141 --> 05:57.667
is Zhou Ji Liang's next target.

05:57.950 --> 06:00.706
So, you are staying to deal with Zhou Ji Liang.

06:08.261 --> 06:09.647
How are you going to handle him?

06:10.885 --> 06:12.108
With your life?

06:13.125 --> 06:15.212
Others might not know about your health condition.

06:15.357 --> 06:16.603
But I know exactly what's going on.

06:16.895 --> 06:19.558
Although the rash on your shoulder has faded a bit,

06:19.654 --> 06:21.261
it'll come back in two days.

06:21.852 --> 06:23.826
When that happens, the poison will hit even harder.

06:25.701 --> 06:27.963
- I understand.   - You don't understand.

06:28.485 --> 06:30.011
You're gambling your life against fate.

06:30.662 --> 06:33.452
If you don't fight, maybe you could live another month.

06:33.701 --> 06:36.403
But if you push yourself to use fight, you could drop dead...

06:48.430 --> 06:49.653
Today,

06:50.560 --> 06:52.806
Ming Zhu Er went to the city gate to find Zhou Ji Liang.

06:54.637 --> 06:56.242
Couldn't you tell what he was up to?

06:57.280 --> 06:59.837
The trouble with Yaksha started because of me.

07:00.181 --> 07:01.507
It's on me to make things right.

07:03.478 --> 07:04.864
You're not God.

07:05.765 --> 07:08.586
Is all the suffering in this world yours to carry alone?

07:09.285 --> 07:10.804
The fake Yaksha was evil from the start.

07:10.895 --> 07:14.908
With or without Yaksha, he'd still commit all kinds of crimes.

07:15.409 --> 07:17.540
What he did wrong has nothing to do with you.

07:17.620 --> 07:20.004
No. If you saw those innocent people

07:20.565 --> 07:23.746
dying one after another right in front of you as I did,

07:27.862 --> 07:29.628
you couldn't forgive yourself either.

07:32.437 --> 07:33.660
Zhan Zhao.

07:35.150 --> 07:36.836
Since I'm already on this crazy ride with you,

07:37.640 --> 07:39.126
I won't back out halfway.

07:41.293 --> 07:44.547
Promise me to stay alive and wait for me to finish things in Xiangyang.

07:50.160 --> 07:52.160
(Wanshan County)

08:06.997 --> 08:08.220
My Lord.

08:08.878 --> 08:11.845
The silver our master asked for is almost ready.

08:12.245 --> 08:13.526
How are the people reacting to this?

08:13.617 --> 08:16.506
They still have some complaints.

08:16.880 --> 08:19.039
But when they heard it was your order,

08:19.130 --> 08:21.763
every household handed over quite a bit of money to us.

08:26.494 --> 08:28.140
Zhou Ji Liang has already succeeded.

08:28.757 --> 08:29.997
Just as you predicted,

08:30.088 --> 08:32.294
Zhan Zhao is staying back in Gucheng County.

08:33.285 --> 08:35.450
Huo Ling Long has already gone back to the Huo family.

08:37.918 --> 08:38.997
What about Bai Yu Tang?

08:39.088 --> 08:40.494
He's escorting Siming to Xiangyang.

08:44.341 --> 08:45.661
Still, we should stay alert.

08:45.760 --> 08:47.640
Tell the people and the officers to stay sharp.

08:47.750 --> 08:49.041
Keep a close watch on the city gates.

08:49.132 --> 08:51.763
We absolutely can't let Bai Yu Tang sneak into the county.

08:58.364 --> 08:59.404
Giddy-up!

08:59.540 --> 09:00.637
Giddy-up!

09:05.005 --> 09:06.132
Giddy-up!

09:06.829 --> 09:08.052
Giddy-up!

09:19.693 --> 09:20.693
Lady Ling Long.

09:20.832 --> 09:23.547
Commander Shao has been waiting for you inside.

09:35.600 --> 09:37.543
Didn't I tell you not to come back?

09:44.880 --> 09:47.195
Uncle Huo. I told you

09:48.102 --> 09:49.325
she'd come back.

10:05.000 --> 10:07.365
I tried to talk sense into you so many times before,

10:08.549 --> 10:09.772
but you never cared.

10:10.269 --> 10:13.026
You forced me to expose the Huo family's true colors

10:13.117 --> 10:15.082
in front of Zhan Zhao and the others.

10:18.789 --> 10:20.515
We've come to this today

10:22.406 --> 10:24.132
because of your choices.

10:36.311 --> 10:39.291
You won't make me take those betrothal gifts back

10:39.429 --> 10:40.946
to the Shao residence today again, right?

10:43.430 --> 10:45.049
I'll move the wedding date up.

10:45.140 --> 10:46.985
We'd better hurry and get ready.

10:48.685 --> 10:50.011
Who exactly is Shan Gui?

10:54.892 --> 10:56.115
Is it my father

10:58.013 --> 10:59.236
or my brother?

11:00.126 --> 11:01.349
Neither.

11:05.733 --> 11:06.956
Shan Gui

11:12.949 --> 11:14.172
is you.

11:18.342 --> 11:20.804
By tradition, I should only tell you

11:20.965 --> 11:23.561
the secret of the Linglong Eye after we get married.

11:24.485 --> 11:28.387
But I guess if you go to your great-aunt now, she won't hide it anymore.

11:29.501 --> 11:31.026
You should go and find the previous Shan Gui.

11:31.805 --> 11:33.092
She'll tell you everything,

11:33.614 --> 11:35.619
exactly as it happened.

12:00.942 --> 12:03.907
Looks like I'm a step too late.

12:04.564 --> 12:06.610
You've already sent the magistrate away.

12:07.197 --> 12:09.283
Do you think you have everything figured out?

12:12.181 --> 12:13.740
But did you predict

12:13.831 --> 12:16.913
that someone would go after the coroner from back then?

12:24.630 --> 12:27.260
Zhan Zhao. All of us want to help you.

12:28.293 --> 12:30.698
We all want to help you bring those villains to justice.

12:32.756 --> 12:34.245
If you fight me,

12:34.445 --> 12:37.317
you won't make it to the academy in time to save the dean.

12:38.797 --> 12:41.329
Do you think you are some kind of hero fighting for justice?

12:41.440 --> 12:44.627
Let me tell you! You're nothing! You're honestly way too naive!

13:06.278 --> 13:08.960
The prosperity and decline of our Linglong Manor

13:09.110 --> 13:11.516
all come from this internal cultivation technique.

13:12.038 --> 13:14.697
The secret of the Linglong Eye that you want to know

13:14.949 --> 13:16.714
is hidden in this technique too.

13:17.308 --> 13:19.946
The founders of our Linglong Manor

13:20.086 --> 13:21.451
were a married couple.

13:22.020 --> 13:25.083
The man created a qinggong technique called "Fleeting Speed."

13:25.286 --> 13:26.811
He also forged the Yin Yang Blade.

13:27.199 --> 13:29.413
While the woman created the Lingyun Sword style.

13:29.869 --> 13:32.667
Your father must have told you all of these.

13:35.029 --> 13:36.309
But do you remember

13:36.500 --> 13:38.627
how you mastered

13:38.718 --> 13:40.365
your "Listening to Flowers Through the Night?"

13:43.773 --> 13:45.660
I think it was when I was 16.

13:46.326 --> 13:49.003
My father showed me a manual on internal cultivation.

13:52.196 --> 13:55.211
The founder of our Huo family, Huo Xiao,

13:55.613 --> 13:58.226
didn't just create the Lingyun Sword style.

13:58.405 --> 14:01.130
She also created the Linglong Cultivation technique.

14:03.366 --> 14:06.412
This technique is extremely gentle and feminine.

14:06.893 --> 14:08.859
Only women can master it.

14:10.080 --> 14:12.280
There are seven levels to this technique.

14:12.371 --> 14:14.782
The "Listening to Flowers Through the Night" you practiced

14:14.873 --> 14:16.096
is just the beginner level.

14:16.492 --> 14:19.590
If you reach the fourth level and combine it with the Yin Yang Blade,

14:19.933 --> 14:23.106
you'll be able to sense subtle changes in energy flow

14:23.229 --> 14:24.596
to find minerals and locate acupoints.

14:27.070 --> 14:30.047
That's the Linglong Eye that the people in the martial world talk about.

14:33.400 --> 14:37.106
The Linglong Eye is a secret technique for finding minerals and acupoints.

14:37.500 --> 14:40.083
So all those legends about the Linglong Eye

14:40.597 --> 14:42.293
were just misinformation spread by the Huo family.

14:45.085 --> 14:48.466
The Huo family is deliberately hiding the truth.

14:49.040 --> 14:51.299
Otherwise, if this secret ever got out,

14:51.390 --> 14:54.963
the powerful clans and nobles would covet and fight over it.

14:55.109 --> 14:58.075
And the same tragedy would happen to the Huo family.

14:59.957 --> 15:01.883
When the Linglong technique was first created,

15:02.333 --> 15:05.021
a Huo family disciple leaked it out.

15:05.174 --> 15:06.397
Suddenly,

15:06.606 --> 15:09.471
we were attacked by all the sects and clans one after another.

15:09.662 --> 15:12.427
The Linglong technique was split into six incomplete scrolls.

15:12.766 --> 15:14.372
One stayed with the Huo family.

15:14.949 --> 15:17.275
The rest were scattered across the martial world.

15:18.828 --> 15:21.866
Does this scroll contain the first three levels of the technique?

15:22.541 --> 15:24.427
As for the rest of the scrolls that others got,

15:24.557 --> 15:26.284
without these three levels as a foundation,

15:27.261 --> 15:28.627
they were basically worthless.

15:31.717 --> 15:32.940
Back then,

15:33.525 --> 15:36.507
too many sects stormed the Huo family.

15:37.605 --> 15:38.977
There were so many

15:39.068 --> 15:41.669
that even they lost track of who had the first few levels of the technique.

15:41.959 --> 15:43.182
For a period of time,

15:44.229 --> 15:46.275
they were killing each other over it

15:46.516 --> 15:47.882
like madmen.

15:49.341 --> 15:50.947
After all the fighting,

15:51.734 --> 15:53.180
everyone went their separate ways.

15:54.398 --> 15:55.621
The Huo family

15:55.957 --> 15:58.667
had kept the Linglong technique a secret ever since.

15:59.197 --> 16:01.082
That was how we finally got a few generations of peace.

16:01.628 --> 16:02.851
Until

16:03.782 --> 16:06.027
the Xuanqing Sect found the Huo family.

16:09.654 --> 16:10.877
You mentioned before

16:11.533 --> 16:13.219
that you and the sect leader of the Xuanqing Sect

16:14.406 --> 16:15.770
were forced into a marriage alliance.

16:17.628 --> 16:20.804
Did they have other fragments of the technique?

16:21.605 --> 16:23.051
What they held in their hands

16:23.517 --> 16:25.284
was the third level of the technique.

16:26.429 --> 16:28.139
Somehow, they found out

16:28.230 --> 16:30.618
that the first two levels were hidden in the Huo family.

16:30.757 --> 16:34.066
They threatened to expose the secret unless their demands were met.

16:34.469 --> 16:36.869
They forced us into a marriage alliance with the Xuanqing Sect

16:36.960 --> 16:39.507
to search for the other missing fragments together.

16:40.884 --> 16:42.400
For the sake of the Huo family's peace,

16:43.366 --> 16:44.852
I had no choice but to marry him.

16:47.318 --> 16:49.558
But the Xuanqing Sect got greedy.

16:49.729 --> 16:52.186
They realized that the key to unlocking the Linglong Eye

16:52.542 --> 16:54.462
was using it together with the Yin Yang Blade.

16:54.553 --> 16:56.034
So they plotted to seize

16:56.125 --> 17:00.009
the first two levels of the technique and Yin Yang Blade for themselves.

17:00.120 --> 17:02.360
From then on, the Huo family refused to put up with it any longer.

17:02.449 --> 17:03.895
After a fierce struggle,

17:04.366 --> 17:06.691
we finally took back the third level of the technique.

17:08.102 --> 17:09.325
But even then,

17:10.541 --> 17:13.962
the nightmare for the Huo family women was far from over.

17:15.422 --> 17:16.645
Do you mean

17:17.477 --> 17:18.700
the Lin family

17:19.382 --> 17:20.501
from the Qingshan Sect?

17:20.653 --> 17:22.979
The Lin family was already working for He Bo.

17:23.437 --> 17:25.663
Not only did he try to force a marriage with the Huo family,

17:25.754 --> 17:28.012
but he also revealed the secret of the technique to He Bo.

17:28.568 --> 17:30.713
He Bo came to negotiate with your father.

17:30.840 --> 17:34.404
He promised to help the Huo family recover all the lost fragments.

17:34.495 --> 17:35.742
But in exchange,

17:36.124 --> 17:38.011
he wanted your aunt to serve Prince Xiangyang

17:38.244 --> 17:40.818
and become his fourth Great Lord

17:40.998 --> 17:42.458
and continue to find gold mines for him.

17:42.709 --> 17:44.476
Of course, your father refused.

17:44.701 --> 17:46.187
So He Bo

17:46.398 --> 17:48.443
kept coming to pressure them.

17:49.620 --> 17:51.267
So when my aunt found out,

17:51.941 --> 17:53.307
she ran away from the Huo family.

17:54.604 --> 17:56.210
When your aunt went to the Lin family,

17:56.381 --> 17:57.908
besides breaking off the engagement,

17:58.045 --> 18:00.826
she also wanted to help us recover the fourth level of the technique.

18:02.141 --> 18:04.719
But who knew she was a step too late.

18:04.887 --> 18:09.147
She saw He Bo leading his men slaughtering the entire Lin family.

18:11.510 --> 18:13.030
The Lin family's original plan

18:13.121 --> 18:15.406
was to impress He Bo and earn his favor.

18:16.093 --> 18:18.699
But it ended in tragedy.

18:20.325 --> 18:21.651
Not long after,

18:22.852 --> 18:25.219
all the lost fragments

18:25.436 --> 18:27.882
ended up in the hands of Prince Xiangyang.

18:28.560 --> 18:29.783
From then on,

18:30.316 --> 18:33.186
he had leverage over the Huo family.

18:34.517 --> 18:36.122
So after my aunt passed away,

18:36.701 --> 18:38.027
you had no choice

18:38.653 --> 18:40.809
but to become the Shan Gui under the Prince of Xiangyang.

18:43.334 --> 18:44.820
So, the gold mine in Wanshan County

18:45.069 --> 18:47.547
was found by you for Prince Xiangyang after you mastered

18:47.918 --> 18:49.457
the fourth level of the technique.

18:52.989 --> 18:54.212
Originally,

18:54.500 --> 18:57.309
your father and I thought that my scarification alone

18:57.422 --> 19:00.033
could bring peace for future generations of the Huo family.

19:00.120 --> 19:03.205
But Prince Xiangyang wasn't satisfied even after getting the gold mine.

19:04.270 --> 19:07.659
He wanted your dad to marry you off to his son, Shao Ji Zu.

19:07.750 --> 19:10.162
Only then would he return all the fragments of the Linglong technique

19:10.252 --> 19:11.916
to the Huo family.

19:12.806 --> 19:14.463
So when I came back last time,

19:16.960 --> 19:19.143
you refused to tell me the secret of the Linglong Eye.

19:19.509 --> 19:22.561
You even advised me to leave the Huo family.

19:22.640 --> 19:24.987
You wanted to shoulder the fate of being the Shan Gui alone.

19:26.806 --> 19:28.106
For the Huo family,

19:29.767 --> 19:31.487
you sacrificed yourself twice.

19:33.230 --> 19:34.776
You gave up your whole life.

19:35.942 --> 19:37.588
No matter how hard my life gets,

19:39.429 --> 19:41.516
I've already survived most of it.

19:44.173 --> 19:46.139
I don't want you to go through

19:47.525 --> 19:49.332
what I've suffered all over again.

19:51.013 --> 19:54.707
So even when I knew your leaving would anger Prince Xiangyang,

19:56.838 --> 19:58.796
I still said what I had to say.

20:04.420 --> 20:05.643
My little girl.

20:07.638 --> 20:08.883
Don't blame your father.

20:09.126 --> 20:10.349
From beginning to end,

20:10.997 --> 20:12.764
he has never cared about the technique.

20:13.589 --> 20:16.027
He did it for the peace of future generations of the Huo family.

20:16.800 --> 20:18.805
As long as the fragments are out there,

20:20.029 --> 20:21.715
the nightmare for the Huo family women

20:23.093 --> 20:24.779
will never end.

20:38.240 --> 20:40.240
(Jiacheng Academy)

20:59.068 --> 21:00.188
Have a seat.

21:00.340 --> 21:01.563
Where's the dean?

21:02.036 --> 21:03.259
He's fine.

21:03.557 --> 21:07.004
I just had Zhou Ji Liang find an excuse to send you here.

21:08.886 --> 21:10.290
Keep me company and let's reminisce.

21:43.078 --> 21:45.707
See? I told you he would be here.

21:47.030 --> 21:49.324
Another night without sleep?

21:49.520 --> 21:52.664
The exam is still months away. No need to push yourself so hard.

21:52.941 --> 21:55.323
You're one to talk. You go to bed late too.

21:56.422 --> 21:58.866
Sometimes, I really envy Zhan Zhao.

21:59.044 --> 22:01.324
He seems like he doesn't care about fame or success at all.

22:01.653 --> 22:03.659
You never thought about

22:03.878 --> 22:06.488
gaining fame and status by taking the exam route, right?

22:12.077 --> 22:13.443
When my parents sent me here,

22:13.629 --> 22:16.166
they said as long as I read the classics,

22:16.390 --> 22:17.830
broaden my knowledge,

22:17.921 --> 22:19.878
and become an honest, wise person, that's enough.

22:19.969 --> 22:21.169
As for fame and status,

22:21.240 --> 22:23.600
if I pass the exam, that's just a bonus.

22:23.806 --> 22:25.896
If not, they won't force it either.

22:26.005 --> 22:28.592
But being an honest, wise person

22:28.703 --> 22:29.926
isn't easy.

22:30.229 --> 22:31.941
That's a lifelong challenge.

22:35.142 --> 22:38.027
Do you know why Xiao Chen is so stressed about the exams?

22:40.044 --> 22:41.571
His marriage is already set.

22:41.662 --> 22:43.302
If he fails the exams this time,

22:43.453 --> 22:45.100
he's worried his future father-in-law

22:45.445 --> 22:46.638
will change his mind.

22:46.729 --> 22:49.328
Shut up. Don't jinx it with that kind of talk.

22:49.419 --> 22:52.109
If my engagement falls through, I'll be coming to your house for meals.

22:52.261 --> 22:53.768
We don't have enough money to feed you.

22:55.229 --> 22:56.768
Coming here today

22:57.182 --> 22:59.586
makes me recall our days as students.

23:00.205 --> 23:01.428
It really makes me sentimental.

23:02.840 --> 23:05.747
We're not the same as we were back then, full of ambition and energy.

23:07.720 --> 23:10.459
Xi Wen broke off the engagement, and we never got married.

23:10.910 --> 23:12.133
Liu failed the exam.

23:12.870 --> 23:14.116
Of the three of us,

23:14.360 --> 23:17.520
it seems only you have truly stayed true to yourself.

23:21.910 --> 23:23.675
How dare you mention Liu?

23:24.702 --> 23:26.382
You serve Prince Xiangyang

23:26.485 --> 23:28.931
and end up helping cause his death.

23:29.200 --> 23:30.846
He chose the wrong path himself.

23:32.120 --> 23:34.319
I can't stand to see you make the same stubborn mistakes he did.

23:34.410 --> 23:36.947
That's why I came here to give you one more chance.

23:38.622 --> 23:40.848
Zhan Zhao. Let it go.

23:41.006 --> 23:44.263
Stop investigating the gold mine case and stay away from my Wanshan County.

23:44.661 --> 23:47.375
You already have Siming in your hands. That's enough to report back.

23:47.709 --> 23:49.830
After this, just use your recurring injury as an excuse

23:49.921 --> 23:51.367
to reject taking on this task.

23:54.301 --> 23:57.547
Lord Hu, you've even planned my escape route for me.

24:04.160 --> 24:05.566
In the Jin Xue Wen case,

24:06.334 --> 24:08.500
you've offended countless colleagues.

24:08.957 --> 24:10.608
They think about it day and night,

24:10.699 --> 24:12.506
wishing that they could take you down.

24:12.854 --> 24:16.270
You serve the court. Although your record is spotless,

24:16.902 --> 24:18.393
your past...

24:21.293 --> 24:23.419
I've heard some officials in court

24:24.053 --> 24:26.219
have already found your weak spot.

24:28.661 --> 24:31.478
We were classmates back in the day.

24:31.839 --> 24:34.644
No one knows your past better than I do.

24:35.429 --> 24:36.430
Tell me.

24:36.613 --> 24:38.218
Should I take advantage of this opportunity

24:38.558 --> 24:41.780
and add fuel to the fire about the Yaksha case?

24:43.484 --> 24:45.411
If the old Yaksha case is brought up again,

24:45.822 --> 24:50.244
are you going to use the real and fake Yaksha argument to defend yourself?

24:50.598 --> 24:52.478
The court won't bother

24:52.569 --> 24:55.179
figuring out which Yaksha was killing innocent people.

24:55.270 --> 24:58.524
What they'll care about is that a government official who enforces the law

24:58.615 --> 24:59.980
took the law into his own hands

25:00.468 --> 25:02.514
and trampled on the law.

25:03.757 --> 25:05.243
When the public is in an uproar,

25:06.078 --> 25:07.643
even Lord Bao and His Majesty

25:08.429 --> 25:09.996
will not be able to protect you.

25:14.582 --> 25:16.108
I've already written the report.

25:16.964 --> 25:18.187
Whether I submit it or not,

25:19.820 --> 25:21.587
it depends on your choice.

25:46.092 --> 25:47.315
Zhan Zhao,

25:47.773 --> 25:50.666
do you really want to keep pushing me like this?

25:51.400 --> 25:53.880
You are willing to come to the academy to save the dean who slandered you,

25:53.965 --> 25:55.292
but you won't let me go.

25:56.181 --> 25:58.296
In your eyes, am I really worse than him?

25:58.520 --> 26:00.586
Do you really think that I, Hu Xiao Chen,

26:00.677 --> 26:02.644
have been doing evil in Wanshan County all these years?

26:02.973 --> 26:04.093
Do you even know

26:04.184 --> 26:07.426
how Prince Xiangyang mined for gold 10 years ago?

26:07.680 --> 26:09.797
Back then, young boys like Duan Shi Lang who went missing

26:09.888 --> 26:12.680
were all kidnapped and taken to Gucheng County to dig in the mines.

26:12.840 --> 26:15.921
The laborers worked themselves to death, never earning a single coin.

26:16.000 --> 26:18.040
After they died, their bodies were simply buried somewhere.

26:18.126 --> 26:20.171
Their families couldn't even find their remains.

26:20.493 --> 26:22.887
Later, Prince Xiangyang came to Wanshan County to open new mines.

26:22.978 --> 26:24.201
When I first arrived in the county,

26:24.680 --> 26:27.826
the situation in the county was exactly like Gucheng.

26:28.310 --> 26:31.712
Things only got better after I took over the gold mine.

26:31.847 --> 26:35.492
Wanshan County is prosperous now, all thanks to me!

26:41.101 --> 26:42.426
But it's also you

26:43.477 --> 26:46.004
who treated people's lives like they meant nothing.

26:46.638 --> 26:48.044
You killed innocent people.

26:48.910 --> 26:51.243
When you first took office, to establish your authority,

26:51.382 --> 26:53.068
you staged acts with the Xiuluo Sect

26:53.390 --> 26:55.356
and ordered them to slaughter the people.

26:55.678 --> 26:58.178
During your term, you served Prince Xiangyang

26:58.418 --> 27:01.507
and made everyone in the county an accomplice to the prince.

27:02.245 --> 27:04.251
Countless miners died because of it.

27:04.516 --> 27:07.098
Not long ago, to protect Zhao Yue An

27:07.358 --> 27:10.146
and stop us from investigating the skeleton case,

27:10.901 --> 27:12.946
you did whatever it took

27:13.277 --> 27:15.524
and ended up killing innocent people.

27:16.772 --> 27:18.498
In all these cases,

27:19.701 --> 27:21.268
have I accused you wrongly in any of them?

27:21.862 --> 27:23.387
When you killed these people,

27:23.878 --> 27:26.798
did you ever think they were your own people?

27:26.889 --> 27:29.727
Wanshan is only prosperous today because of me.

27:29.818 --> 27:31.744
So what if I killed a few people?

27:32.236 --> 27:34.458
I killed them to protect even more people.

27:34.549 --> 27:35.950
As long as most people are doing well,

27:36.096 --> 27:37.855
how is it wrong to sacrifice a few?

27:38.180 --> 27:40.014
Honestly, even if the people knew the truth,

27:40.105 --> 27:42.467
they'd still think I was right to kill a few for the greater good.

27:42.645 --> 27:46.327
They'd even pick a few of the least important ones for me to kill.

27:46.422 --> 27:48.176
Just like how they'd offer up their young and strong

27:48.286 --> 27:49.891
to risk their lives mining.

27:50.126 --> 27:51.720
Hu Xiao Chen, have you lost your mind?

27:54.564 --> 27:56.967
Do you really care about your people?

27:57.661 --> 27:59.667
Or are you just using innocent lives

28:00.039 --> 28:02.232
to pave the way for your own ambition?

28:06.382 --> 28:07.628
They were innocent.

28:08.509 --> 28:10.435
But they could only blame themselves for being unlucky.

28:10.823 --> 28:14.467
Zhan Zhao, there's too much injustice in this world.

28:14.614 --> 28:17.267
Not everyone deserves justice.

28:20.694 --> 28:22.351
If you were to be sacrificed

28:22.942 --> 28:24.608
for Prince Xiangyang's gain,

28:25.406 --> 28:27.292
would you say the same?

28:29.870 --> 28:32.787
I, Hu Xiao Chen, earned Prince Xiangyang's trust

28:32.996 --> 28:36.106
and became someone the people see as the savior of Wanshan County

28:36.629 --> 28:38.075
not because of luck,

28:38.278 --> 28:39.501
but because of my ability!

28:40.669 --> 28:42.428
I'm not someone whose life is worthless.

28:42.917 --> 28:45.826
I'll never become one of those who get sacrificed.

29:00.240 --> 29:02.515
But to your master,

29:03.520 --> 29:05.468
everyone is expendable.

29:07.070 --> 29:10.527
Just wait and see how he treats you when you mess up.

29:13.560 --> 29:15.143
I know he's just using me.

29:15.376 --> 29:16.937
But I'm using him too.

29:17.134 --> 29:21.707
All the dirty work I do for him now is just a means to an end.

29:21.926 --> 29:25.187
Once I reach the top, I'll bring prosperity to all the people.

29:25.701 --> 29:27.296
Then you'll see

29:27.387 --> 29:29.939
that I, Hu Xiao Chen, have never forgotten about my original intentions.

29:30.030 --> 29:31.276
Stop lying to yourself!

29:34.014 --> 29:36.724
You're no longer the Hu Xiao Chen you used to be.

29:39.284 --> 29:40.680
There's no going back for you.

29:45.600 --> 29:46.823
Now,

29:48.598 --> 29:51.724
even if you had to sacrifice a whole city to get what you want,

29:53.400 --> 29:54.907
you wouldn't even hesitate.

29:59.838 --> 30:01.296
There's no going back for you.

30:02.046 --> 30:03.532
I'm not wrong!

30:04.638 --> 30:06.154
You're the one who's wrong!

30:06.469 --> 30:07.892
I haven't failed yet.

30:07.983 --> 30:09.270
I'm not at the end of my rope.

30:10.133 --> 30:11.460
Since we can't come to an agreement,

30:11.774 --> 30:13.260
then we'll go down together!

30:14.173 --> 30:16.647
Zhan Zhao, you should know

30:16.814 --> 30:19.344
why I had Zhou Ji Liang commit crimes in Gucheng.

30:19.453 --> 30:22.547
And why did I target everyone connected to the Yaksha case?

30:22.991 --> 30:25.582
I wanted to see between you and me,

30:25.673 --> 30:27.633
who would fall from grace

30:27.724 --> 30:29.531
and get ruined beyond redemption first!

30:35.453 --> 30:36.676
Lord Hu,

30:37.317 --> 30:38.540
take your men and leave.

30:39.078 --> 30:40.746
Stop dragging innocent people into this.

30:41.229 --> 30:42.452
We don't need

30:43.324 --> 30:45.891
to fight with Zhou Ji Liang in between us anymore.

31:36.440 --> 31:39.887
I followed the Five Rats' markings all the way from Xiangyang's city gate.

31:40.079 --> 31:43.689
So I knew you two brothers made a smooth trip to Wanshan County.

31:49.800 --> 31:51.800
Wanshan County is making a big show

31:51.891 --> 31:54.586
of putting the whole city in lockdown to guard against the Sleek Rat.

31:54.942 --> 31:57.060
It's way easier with just the two of us.

31:57.600 --> 31:58.791
You may go.

31:58.882 --> 32:00.641
I already told Magistrate Hu.

32:00.732 --> 32:03.009
Too bad he was deaf and blind to it. He thought I was joking.

32:03.231 --> 32:05.089
That courtyard was pretty comfortable for me.

32:05.567 --> 32:08.670
Next time, get me a bigger place. I'll bring my sworn brothers over too.

32:09.316 --> 32:11.154
I might just retire here with you.

32:13.093 --> 32:16.674
Yu Tang, these days, you've become

32:16.765 --> 32:19.855
Zhan Zhao's errand boy.

32:19.946 --> 32:22.819
And now, you want to drag the rest of Xiankong Island into this

32:22.910 --> 32:24.270
and work for him, right?

32:24.429 --> 32:26.746
- Even bossing your sister-in-law around...   - Zhang.

32:31.582 --> 32:33.302
Making her create the Naiheyin Pill for him.

32:33.393 --> 32:35.051
Zhang, I invited you two here.

32:35.160 --> 32:36.640
Just think of it as helping me out, okay?

32:36.724 --> 32:38.971
When you see Zhan Zhao, don't whine or complain.

32:39.062 --> 32:41.643
Otherwise, the Five Rats will look like a bunch of petty losers.

32:49.285 --> 32:51.724
How's sister-in-law's Naiheyin Pill coming along?

32:52.780 --> 32:55.626
She has a pretty good idea now. But it'll still take some time.

32:59.806 --> 33:02.543
Just now, Zhang and I took a look around.

33:02.727 --> 33:05.014
This is a private garden.

33:05.244 --> 33:07.204
There are guards patrolling the grounds,

33:07.295 --> 33:08.639
but the security isn't that tight.

33:09.430 --> 33:12.231
That boat is loaded with real gold and silver.

33:12.320 --> 33:15.842
That old Prince Xiangyang has gathered all his treasure here.

33:16.037 --> 33:19.729
I bet the real secret isn't outside.

33:19.820 --> 33:22.465
It has to be inside the building.

33:26.150 --> 33:29.141
Zhang, Ping, keep an eye on the garden for me.

33:29.232 --> 33:31.787
I'll check out the building and see what secrets it holds.

33:32.413 --> 33:33.938
Yu Tang, be careful.

33:35.080 --> 33:36.365
Don't you trust me?

34:29.917 --> 34:31.140
Father,

34:31.760 --> 34:33.890
I made you some porridge. Have some.

34:34.005 --> 34:35.372
I told Feng to let you know

34:36.036 --> 34:37.259
not to come back.

34:38.316 --> 34:39.683
Why didn't you listen?

34:43.590 --> 34:44.813
If I left,

34:49.640 --> 34:51.405
how would you deal with Prince Xiangyang?

35:08.080 --> 35:09.303
The Baihua Sect

35:09.692 --> 35:11.539
sent this letter to your great-aunt.

35:11.845 --> 35:13.131
I've kept it with me all this time.

35:14.200 --> 35:15.423
Today, I'm giving it to you.

35:20.438 --> 35:22.085
Take the letter and leave right away.

35:22.684 --> 35:23.907
I'll protect you.

35:31.477 --> 35:33.084
Father, tell Shao Ji Zu

35:34.102 --> 35:35.325
that I'll marry him.

35:37.516 --> 35:38.923
But I still don't understand.

35:40.221 --> 35:42.028
Prince Xiangyang already controls the gold mines.

35:43.046 --> 35:46.244
Why risk falling out with the Huo family to force me into this marriage?

35:49.342 --> 35:52.003
You've told me so many times not to return to the Huo family.

35:54.645 --> 35:56.101
Is there something you know that I don't?

36:09.253 --> 36:11.062
A daughter of the Huo family would never run away.

36:12.789 --> 36:15.227
What's really going on with the Linglong Manor now?

36:16.151 --> 36:17.957
Father, please tell me everything honestly.

36:19.206 --> 36:20.429
All the good and the bad.

36:20.885 --> 36:22.108
I'll face it all with you.

36:32.800 --> 36:34.687
I thought the homicide case happened in Gucheng County.

36:34.778 --> 36:37.569
Why is Xiangyang in lockdown too? What a hassle.

36:37.660 --> 36:40.747
I heard the murder in Gucheng County was committed by Lord Yaksha.

36:41.069 --> 36:42.870
Of course the authorities are on edge.

36:42.961 --> 36:46.102
Didn't you see? Anyone dressed like a martial artist

36:46.260 --> 36:48.396
who carries a sword or a blade

36:48.501 --> 36:50.946
is questioned if they want to enter the city.

36:51.173 --> 36:52.396
You probably don't know yet.

36:53.260 --> 36:54.700
It's not just Gucheng County.

36:54.780 --> 36:56.841
Yaksha is causing even more chaos in the capital.

36:56.932 --> 36:59.667
The capital? Yaksha made it to the capital?

37:00.061 --> 37:01.284
Officer.

37:06.212 --> 37:07.435
Hand it over!

37:24.680 --> 37:26.086
(Archives)

37:50.180 --> 37:51.932
Didn't you say you saw the case files?

37:52.023 --> 37:53.753
Why couldn't I find my family's case even after

37:53.844 --> 37:55.515
searching through every file in Nanzhang County?

37:56.461 --> 37:57.684
Can you help me look for it?

37:57.885 --> 37:59.604
Why are you still going through all these files?

37:59.695 --> 38:01.781
These past two days, you've checked them over and over.

38:01.861 --> 38:04.373
I've told you, there's nothing suspicious about your family's case.

38:04.464 --> 38:05.709
Why won't you believe me?

38:27.840 --> 38:29.330
What's the situation in the capital?

38:30.231 --> 38:33.212
It's even messier than the rumors you hear in Xiangyang.

38:39.440 --> 38:40.663
Zhao Zhi Er.

38:41.790 --> 38:43.013
Officer Zhan.

38:43.461 --> 38:44.684
Can we talk for a bit?

38:45.340 --> 38:47.267
Not long after we left Tanxi Town,

38:48.021 --> 38:50.362
someone at court reported the Yaksha incident.

38:50.472 --> 38:52.078
The emperor wanted to keep it quiet at first,

38:52.169 --> 38:55.421
but the officials who dug up the Yaksha case just wouldn't let it go.

38:55.501 --> 38:56.568
His Majesty had no choice

38:56.658 --> 38:58.658
but to assign His Highness to investigate this in secret.

38:59.000 --> 39:02.862
Officer Zhan, His Highness and I kept this from you

39:03.191 --> 39:06.026
mainly because we were worried it would upset you if you found out.

39:07.941 --> 39:11.218
Last time, you saw me talking about the old case with Ming Zhu.

39:11.398 --> 39:13.361
But after that, you didn't ask anything about it.

39:13.452 --> 39:15.883
So I knew you already understood everything.

39:17.901 --> 39:20.324
Zhang Long and Zhao Hu sent me word.

39:21.901 --> 39:24.126
I've come to you because I want to know for sure

39:24.217 --> 39:25.943
what's really going on in the capital right now.

39:26.806 --> 39:28.647
I reported to the capital that Zhou Ji Liang is using

39:28.769 --> 39:31.258
Yaksha's name to cover up his murders of innocent people.

39:31.541 --> 39:33.667
I thought it would clear your name.

39:34.421 --> 39:37.506
I didn't expect that so many Yaksha copycats would show up in the capital.

39:37.703 --> 39:40.607
Now, those people at court have even more reason to attack you.

39:40.698 --> 39:43.346
Half the officials at court are demanding you be severely punished.

39:43.685 --> 39:45.125
Lord Bao is fighting hard for you,

39:45.381 --> 39:46.805
but he's being impeached for it.

39:48.360 --> 39:51.862
The emperor also knows the Prince Xiangyang case is at a critical point.

39:52.092 --> 39:55.063
But with Yaksha causing chaos in Dongjing, the officials are furious.

39:55.180 --> 39:56.791
Those Yaksha copycats in the capital

39:56.882 --> 39:58.401
must be the work of Prince Xiangyang.

39:58.492 --> 40:00.031
If I'm removed and investigated,

40:00.244 --> 40:02.644
and the court sends someone else to take over this case,

40:03.021 --> 40:05.492
I'm afraid there won't be enough time to stop Prince Xiangyang's plan.

40:06.040 --> 40:08.180
Officer Zhan, Imperial Envoy Lord Chu

40:08.260 --> 40:11.457
is very close to those officials trying to bring you down.

40:11.548 --> 40:14.472
He's asked the prince several times to review the Yaksha case files,

40:14.602 --> 40:15.843
but His Highness turned him down.

40:15.966 --> 40:18.180
This morning, I saw people from the Wanshan County office

40:18.260 --> 40:19.483
come looking for Lord Chu.

40:19.917 --> 40:21.140
You need to be careful.

40:22.861 --> 40:24.707
Since you don't care about your own life,

40:24.941 --> 40:27.346
then I'll have no choice but to go after the people you care about.

40:27.581 --> 40:29.227
That's the only way to force you to leave.

40:30.108 --> 40:31.331
Ming Zhu Er.

40:48.260 --> 40:49.483
Greetings, Lord Chu.

40:50.204 --> 40:53.204
Lord Chu, I didn't mean to mess up the files.

40:53.421 --> 40:54.644
I'll put everything back in order.

41:00.320 --> 41:01.543
It's chilly outside.

41:02.037 --> 41:03.260
Come in and let's talk.

41:13.620 --> 41:16.307
I heard from the clerks

41:17.692 --> 41:20.747
that these past two days, you've buried yourself in the

41:21.052 --> 41:22.253
archives at the yamen,

41:22.344 --> 41:25.030
searching through case files day and night.

41:26.260 --> 41:27.506
I also heard

41:27.956 --> 41:30.866
that you have an interesting little steward from the prince's manor

41:31.101 --> 41:32.667
by your side.

41:33.225 --> 41:34.381
He knows full well

41:34.461 --> 41:37.986
that even if you turn the archives completely upside down,

41:38.211 --> 41:40.058
it still won't help.

41:40.861 --> 41:44.307
But he still sticks by your side.

41:46.381 --> 41:49.627
Actually, all the files related to Yaksha

41:51.340 --> 41:52.946
are with Prince Hui.

41:54.061 --> 41:57.346
I've requested to see them many times.

41:58.061 --> 41:59.787
But Prince Hui

42:00.620 --> 42:01.843
keeps refusing to let me do so.

42:02.340 --> 42:06.147
So I had to find someone in private

42:06.941 --> 42:08.307
to secretly copy a set for me.

42:15.861 --> 42:17.346
Ten years ago,

42:19.981 --> 42:23.147
the Ming family of hunters in Nanzhang County,

42:24.275 --> 42:25.802
all three of them,

42:26.421 --> 42:28.307
were killed by Yaksha.

42:28.820 --> 42:30.043
Is this the file

42:30.501 --> 42:32.267
you've been looking for?

42:32.541 --> 42:35.386
Lord Chu, please let me see the file.

42:35.861 --> 42:37.346
I can let you see it.

42:39.140 --> 42:40.426
But you have to promise me

42:41.461 --> 42:44.187
that you'll be my witness for this case.

42:45.240 --> 42:47.247
You must testify that it was Yaksha

42:47.723 --> 42:49.730
who killed your whole family.

42:49.981 --> 42:51.204
Yaksha?

42:51.381 --> 42:52.787
Do you mean Zhou Ji Liang?

42:53.180 --> 42:55.684
Wasn't he sentenced to death for this case ages ago?

42:56.140 --> 42:59.307
Zhou Ji Liang was sentenced to death?

43:00.700 --> 43:02.307
Did Zhan Zhao tell you that?

43:03.820 --> 43:05.067
He lied to you.
